{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank Fight Ready is a tank shooting game, players can fight each other in team deathmatch or free for all mode. AI can be added to support single player games and multiplayer games based on the Internet or LAN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include 8 tanks with different parameters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include 6 props, randomly generated on the map:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightning Attack - Causes lightning attacks on enemy units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Fire Rate - Increase Shooting Speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield - Obtain a shield on your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflect Damage - Reflect damage to the enemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Shot Kill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb - Kill all enemy units</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539230?t=1761484459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539230?t=1761484459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539230/265a56d19615484647d42b197f9d03d7cfb4f5fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761484459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539230/265a56d19615484647d42b197f9d03d7cfb4f5fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761484459","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank Fight Ready is a tank shooting game,